#. <CLT 4>とにかく…
#. まずは現場となった<CLT><CLT 3>“ボクの部屋”<CLT><CLT 4>に行こう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>First of all, I should head to the scene of the\n"
"crime—<CLT><CLT 3>my room<CLT><CLT 4>.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あそこを調べない限り…
#. 何も始まらないんだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>We won't make any progress without investigating\n"
"there.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして、ボクは向かった…
#. 舞園さんの死体があるはずのボクの部屋へと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So I headed to my room, where Sayaka's corpse still\n"
"remained.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あぁ、掃除当番か。
msgctxt "0004 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "Cleaning duty, eh?"
msgstr ""

#. それなら昨日の朝、
#. モノクマから話があったな！
msgctxt "0005 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"As a matter of fact, Monokuma came and talked to me\n"
"yesterday morning!"
msgstr ""

#. …ホント！？
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Really!?"
msgstr ""

#. きっと、モノクマも僕がまとめ役だとわかってたんだ！
#. だから僕に直々に言ってきたのだよ。
msgctxt "0007 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"He probably realized I was basically in charge, so he\n"
"decided to talk to me directly!"
msgstr ""

#. 掃除当番を決めてくれってね！！
msgctxt "0008 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"The topic of conversation was...assigning cleaning\n"
"duty!"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、石丸クンが掃除当番だったんだね…
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Oh, so you're on cleaning duty now?"
msgstr ""

#. いや、僕は掃除当番ではないぞ。
msgctxt "0010 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "Actually, no."
msgstr ""

#. …えっ？　じゃあ誰が？
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh? Okay, then who is?"
msgstr ""

#. その話があった時、ちょうど山田くんもいてな、
#. 立候補してくれたんで、彼にお願いしたんだ！
msgctxt "0012 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"Hifumi was also there when we had this conversation.\n"
"He volunteered right away, so I let him have it!"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、掃除当番は…山田クン？
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "So *he's* on cleaning duty, then."
msgstr ""

#. 掃除当番は１週間ごとに交代していく予定だ。
#. いずれ、君にもお願いする事があるだろう…
msgctxt "0014 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"Indeed. But we'll swap out on a weekly basis. I'm sure\n"
"you'll be up before too long."
msgstr ""

#. その時はよろしく頼むぞッ！！
msgctxt "0015 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "And when that time comes, I'll be counting on you!"
msgstr ""

#. 掃除当番の話があった時、ちょうど山田くんもいてな、
#. 彼が立候補してくれたんで、彼にお願いしたんだ！
msgctxt "0016 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"Hifumi was there for the cleaning duty discussion, and\n"
"he asked for the job. So I gave it to him!"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、掃除当番は…山田クン？
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "So *he's* on cleaning duty, then."
msgstr ""

#. 掃除当番は１週間ごとに交代していく予定だ。
#. いずれ君にもお願いする事があるだろう…
msgctxt "0018 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"Indeed. But we'll swap out on a weekly basis. I'm sure\n"
"you'll be up before too long."
msgstr ""

#. その時はよろしく頼むぞッ！！
msgctxt "0019 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "And when that time comes, I'll be counting on you!"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木くん、聞いてくれたまえ！
#. 妙な物を発見したんだっ！！
msgctxt "0020 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"Do you have a second, Makoto? I've uncovered something\n"
"most unusual!"
msgstr ""

#. みんなの個室のドアにはネームプレートが
#. 貼り付けられてあっただろう！？
msgctxt "0021 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"The door to everyone's dorm has a nameplate on it to\n"
"show whose room it is, right?"
msgstr ""

#. なんと、あれがだなッ！！
msgctxt "0022 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "Well, it just so happens...!"
msgstr ""

#. おっと、いかんいかんっ！！
#. 犯人かもしれない君にこんな話をするのはマズイな！！
msgctxt "0023 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"Wait! No no no! You might be the killer yourself! I\n"
"can't tell you anything!"
msgstr ""

#. 今のは忘れてくれッ！
#. 忘れろー、忘れろー、忘れろビームッ！！
msgctxt "0024 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"Forget everything I just said! Forget...!\n"
"Forgeeeet...! FORGET BEEEAAAM!"
msgstr ""

#. …なんてな、僕だってジョークくらい言うんだぞ。
#. ハッハッハ！！
msgctxt "0025 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"Sorry, just a little joke. Even I do jokes sometimes!\n"
"Hahaha!"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>階段があるけど…
#. シャッターが降りてる。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I can see some stairs, but the gate is shut tight.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これは、どうすれば開くんだ？
#. 見当も付かないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What the heck do we have to do to get it open? I have\n"
"no idea...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>「ガタガタガタ！」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0029 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>*Rattle rattle*\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 開かない…
#. 鍵が掛かってるみたいだ…
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "The door won't budge. It must be locked."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>「ガタガタガタ！」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0031 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>*Rattle rattle*\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 開かない…
#. 鍵が掛かってるみたいだ…
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "The door won't budge. It must be locked."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここは女子トイレだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is the girls bathroom.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もちろん、入る訳にはいかない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Obviously I can't go in...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
